  "articleBody": "A detached ADU project succeeds when the property, intended use, design, utilities, budget, and permit path are assessed together before construction begins. In San Diego County, the correct approach depends on whether the home is in a city or an unincorporated area, along with setbacks, height, access, sewer or septic service, and site conditions.",
